// Windows application icon resource.
//
// GPUI's Windows backend loads the window icon by integer resource id 1
// (LoadImageW with PCWSTR(1) in src/platform/windows/platform.rs), so the
// icon MUST be declared with the numeric id `1` to show up in the taskbar,
// alt-tab, and the window title bar. Keeping the icon next to the source as
// a relative path means `rc.exe` resolves it from this file's directory.
1 ICON "icon.ico"
